                                "sense_id": "0034d36d-85ee-3daf-9cd0-4b02842ddbb5",
                                "text": "That’s what prompted new FCC Chairman Brendan Carr to send a “letter of inquiry” to CBS, asking the network to hand over the unedited tapes and transcript."
